ew-text">“For the first time, all of our manufacturing data tells one story. Disconnected systems became a single reliable platform, and our operations team finally has insight it can act on.”</p></div><div class="review-card-bottom"><div class="review-bottom-info"><div class="font-regular medium">Marcus Ellison</div><div class="font-small">COO, StratoLink Industries</div></div><img src="/images/6ac4fbdd87676ec08f9b7b52_853b9cbf133e40999967a6e937bb9347_Frame%20%288%29.webp" alt="StratoLink logo" class="review-logo"/></div></div></div><div class="review-slide w-slide"><div class="review-slide-card"><div class="review-card-top"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 47 40" fill="none" class="review-icon"><path d="M47 0L47 8.88889L44.3007 8.88889C38.902 8.88889 37.3142 11.746 37.3142 15.873L37.3142 21.9048L45.5709 21.9048L45.5709 40L28.8986 40L28.8987 14.4444C28.8987 4.44444 34.9324 -1.05498e-06 43.8243 -2.77626e-07L47 0ZM18.1014 -2.5264e-06L18.1014 8.88889L15.402 8.88889C10.0034 8.88889 8.41555 11.746 8.41554 15.873L8.41554 21.9048L16.6723 21.9048L16.6723 40L0 40L2.23414e-06 14.4444C3.10837e-06 4.44443 6.03379 -3.58138e-06 14.9257 -2.80403e-06L18.1014 -2.5264e-06Z" fill="white" fill-opacity="0.2"></path></svg><p class="review-text">“Years of fragile integrations across our clinics are finally gone. Data moves securely between every system, and new digital services now launch in weeks, not quarters.”</p></div><div class="review-card-bottom"><div class="review-bottom-info"><div class="font-regular medium">Priya Raman</div><div class="font-small">CTO, BlazeCore Health</div></div><img src="/images/6ac4fc6070f458292744e313_Frame%20(11).webp" alt="BlazeCore logo" class="review-logo"/></div></div></div><div class="review-slide w-slide"><div class="review-slide-card"><div class="review-card-top"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 47 40" fill="none" class="review-icon"><path d="M47 0L47 8.88889L44.3007 8.88889C38.902 8.